.SH NAME
__hhs_ip - Display the associated machine IP of the given kind.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
usage: __hhs_ip [kind]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Display the associated machine IP of the given kind.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
$1 (Opt)
The kind of IP to get.
.SH DETAILS
.nf

    Arguments:
      type : The kind of IP to get. One of [all|local|external|gateway|vpn]

    Types:
           all : Get all network IPv4
         local : Get your local network IPv4
      external : Get your external network IPv4
       gateway : Get the gateway IPv4
           vpn : Get your IPv4 assigned by your VPN server

  Notes:
    - If no kind is specified, all assigned IPv4s will be retrieved
.fi
